    "diagnosis": "Invasive mucinous adenocarcinoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Tumor cells, which are characterized by goblet and high columnar tumor cells with abundant cytoplasmic mucin, are extended in the lung parenchyma. Mucin is filled with the peripheral area with clusters of air-spreading tumor cells. This tumor showed pneumonia-like consolidation with a CT image. ",
