    "fileId": 15331,
    "type": "WSI",
    "diagnosis": "Invasive mucinous adenocarcinoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "High columnar tumor cells proliferate around the central fibrous scar. Floating alveolar macrophages in the peripheral non-neoplastic air spaces suggest mucinous secretion around the tumor. This tumor was presented as a part-solid nodule with a CT image. ",
    "source": "Yasushi Yatabe",
    "copyright": "",
